==Battleground==
*8 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*8 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Bore]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[J.J. Jackrabbit]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.
**2 [[J.J. Jackrabbit]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 106.67~110 seconds<sup>3,200f~3,300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Spam anti-Red CC fodder and you win. Jackrabbit isn't too bad of a problem, but if you're worried run something with Strong vs. Red.

